                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h2]No More Chances[/h2]\n\nAn okay, yet boring story with some nice voice acting.\n\nYou are overseas, trying to score a huge business deal as the company you work for is slowly fading into bankruptcy. You stumble upon an old friend along the way, you can either choose to pursue her or just treat her like a friend. There's six endings and a lot of choices in-between.\n\nThe UI leaves a lot to be desired and there's no option for skipping between seen or all text, so it lacks the bare minimum. There's not even any CGs, how disappointing.\n\nI definitely can't recommend this one, even if I am easy to please with visual novels, this one is not satisfying or anything adjacent. Skip.",
